 <div class="pro-hero"><div><span class="pro-hero-kicker">YOUR CURRENT SHIFT</span><h2>${active?'Shift #'+active.id+' · OPEN':'No shift is open'}</h2><p>${active?'Opened '+formatDate(active.opened_at)+' · Opening float '+pkr(active.opening_paisa):'Open a shift to track your cash sales and expected drawer total.'}</p></div><div class="pro-hero-badge">${active?'● OPEN':'○ CLOSED'}</div></div>
